        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Near San Francisco’s 2.0 eighth-grade-GPA cutoff, ethnic-studies eligibility increased high-school graduation by 15.7 percentage points.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "This preregistered RD paper reports its full-controls reduced-form ITT estimate (robust SE 0.073; N=1,405) for its preferred imputed graduation measure. It is a causal estimate of eligibility near the cutoff, not a district-wide effect of every ethnic-studies course.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "da4a6c1f9d4446f9832ff3b49a4400ef"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "boolean",
